oted conversation excerpt from fact 11; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nHollis Mbeki (hollis-mbeki, Central team lead) wrote in a direct message with assistant on 2026-10-21 09:00: I need to escalate a Marrow Agrisupply problem today. Who should I call?\n```","id":11,"source":"hollis-mbeki, a direct message with assistant, 2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 1; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nHollis Mbeki (hollis-mbeki, Central team lead) wrote in a direct message with assistant on 2026-10-14 09:00: For future reference, no action needed: my go-to person at Marrow Agrisupply for escalations on the Nettle rollout is Caspian Halvorsen from now on. Please remember that for me.\n```","id":1,"source":"hollis-mbeki, a direct message with assistant, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 6; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in a direct message with hollis-mbeki on 2026-10-16 17:00: I replied to Hollis in the DM and confirmed I've noted Maren Tolland as his go-to escalation contact at Tansley Parcel for the Linden rollout. I didn't save it anywhere separately. The workspace brain stores DM messages automatically and shows them only to the member who sent them, so the note is kept and stays private to Hollis.\n```","id":6,"source":"assistant, a direct message with hollis-mbeki, 2026-10-16T17:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"hollis-mbeki"}
